The table counts each report ID once, even when the export repeats a row. The desk's
one-day notes remain under their tenant-derived cause. Their bodies are not proof of a
day/month swap; keep those notes visible for investigation rather than asserting a new cause.

## Engineering tickets

- [Shared parser reads day-first dates as month-first](https://github.com/filip-szymanski-13/mega-s01e03-what-it-shows/issues/1)
- [booking-v3 hint conflicts with day-first tenant dates](https://github.com/filip-szymanski-13/mega-s01e03-what-it-shows/issues/2)

